codex
The cache supports an exact, non-tuned split: C1 is the sum of atomic association-change deltas, C2 is the sum of atomic adjacent-mode/control deltas, and C3 is the remaining joint residual. I’ll encode each arm as the incumbent score plus the selected subset of those exact numerator/energy deltas; `DROP_C3` will therefore reproduce `ADDITIVE_ONLY` exactly and `FULL` will reproduce `WITH_RESIDUAL` exactly. Mixed association-plus-control rows are not decomposable from the cache, so the runner will assert that none is eligible rather than silently approximate them.
