+        "## Evidence classification", "", "### Verified by running code", "",
+        "The pinned source receipt, source selected-record file, residual-toggle runner, FULLSPAN result, and FULLSPAN runner matched their SHA-256 digests. The code streamed all eight cached anchors, asserted the inherited eligibility and exact singleton-residual identities, reran every factorial selector with exact `Fraction` prices, and exactly reproduced `BASELINE`, `DROP_C3`/`ADDITIVE_ONLY`, and `FULL`/`WITH_RESIDUAL` selections and totals for both numerators.", "",
+        "### Derived on paper", "",
+        "Pooled ratios, requested contrasts, and interaction differences are exact rational arithmetic over the cached binary64 physical outputs. Displayed decimals are formatting only.", "",
+        "### Inferred", "",
+        "These oracle selectors expose ceiling opportunity within this fixed catalogue. They do not establish learnability, deployable policy efficacy, or achievable learned values.", "",
